{"sha": "319504239a9fb532c42f5d9341e2b7419bcc0d76", "message": "Fixes dependency check logic\n\nCorrects the logic for checking if dependencies are installed\nbefore attempting to install them. The previous logic was flawed\nand would not install dependencies even if they were missing.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:50:13Z", "repo": "HydroFetch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d32e0ff33877079b8b4a44fe570062804960dd9d", "message": "Updates version to 2.5.2\n\nIncrements the version number in the script.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:46:35Z", "repo": "HydroFetch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e14b23054b11f07ca39f9cd95cc7c3c755d492c0", "message": "Fixes dependency check logic\n\nCorrects the logic for checking dependencies during installation.\n\nIt uses 'or' instead of 'and' to ensure that installation proceeds if any of the dependencies (git, jq, wget) are missing, even if figlet is present.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:43:54Z", "repo": "HydroFetch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e01b2d129ce11abe18694e63d8bc0a86d91d2522", "message": "Updates version to 2.5.1 and improves min mode.\n\nUpdates the hydrofetch version to 2.5.1 Fish Edition.\n\nImproves the '-m' or '--min' mode to display minimal system information by moving the logic before the logo check to ensure it always executes.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:42Z", "repo": "HydroFetch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0e86f3ae6d9ed137fdc5cce401c32999ee277a09", "message": "Add tux logo on Logos plugin", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:59Z", "repo": "HydroFetch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "28d6ca0260ae388bab7785851ee38b78ced992bf", "message": "Merge pull request #4 from cfgnunes/main\n\nfeat: add support for Fedora Silver Blue (rpm-ostree) and Void Linux \u2026", "creat